### Get Video Info
# Title, uploader, duration, thumbnail and formats (one cached yt-dlp -J call)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/video/info?youtubeUrl=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth.username}} {{basicAuth.password}}

###

### Get Video Info - Short URL (same cache entry)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/video/info?youtubeUrl=https://youtu.be/dQw4w9WgXcQ
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth.username}} {{basicAuth.password}}

###

### Get Video Info - Invalid URL (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/video/info?youtubeUrl=https://vimeo.com/123456
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth.username}} {{basicAuth.password}}

###

### Get Video Info - Missing URL (400 "URL is required")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/video/info
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth.username}} {{basicAuth.password}}
